    "detailed_description": "A cold, dark cave stands between you and your journey to find yourself. In this treacherous world, your clones will have to be sacrificed to get out. Difficult decisions will be made.<br><br><strong>Duped</strong> explores themes of loneliness, isolation, and identity, through a 2D action/puzzle platformer. Control a square on its journey to escape the cave it has found itself in. Create clones, control them, and crawl over their bodies to overcome obstacles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 40 levels<br></li><li> Physics-based puzzles<br></li><li>Minimalist story</li></ul><br><i> After all, they were just disposable parts, weren\u2019t they?<i></i></i>",
